# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# .out/ holds the CMake/Ninja build tree AND vcpkg_installed AND the runtime SPIR-V
# cache -- ~2.9 GB. All of it is reproducible with tools/build.ps1.
/.out/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# vcpkg
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# cmake/vcpkg.cmake clones vcpkg *into the source tree* (cmake/vcpkg.cmake:12). This is
# also why the repo has to live at a short path such as C:\voxl2 -- from a deep root the
# clone exceeds MAX_PATH and git aborts with "Filename too long". ~0.7 GB, and it grows:
# vcpkg downloads its own pinned cmake/7zip/powershell into vcpkg/downloads on first use.
# It is fully reconstructed by a configure, so it is never committed.
/vcpkg/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOT ignored, deliberately
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# deps/ is NOT ignored. deps/gvox and deps/Daxa are vcpkg *overlay ports* whose portfiles
# say `set(SOURCE_PATH "${CMAKE_CURRENT_LIST_DIR}")` -- vcpkg builds them from these exact
# files, in place. They are vendored first-party source now, not submodules, and one of the
# four build fixes lives inside deps/gvox. Losing them means losing the build.
# (Their own nested .gitignore files inherit VS templates that would drop *.lib/*.dll/bin/,
# so they were force-added once at import; see the initial commit message.)
#
# vksdk/ is NOT ignored either. It is the synthesised minimal Vulkan SDK (Vulkan-Headers
# v1.3.260 plus an import library generated from the driver's vulkan-1.dll) that makes this
# tree build without a LunarG SDK installed. 13 MB, and the build cannot start without it.
#
# imgui.ini is NOT ignored (upstream ignored it, but CMakeLists.txt:107 installs it). It
# pins the debug-overlay window geometry that the docs/BASELINE.md screenshot depends on.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor / OS noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vs/
.cache/
compile_commands.json
*.user
*.dot
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
